# Build context is the repo root (see apps/api/Dockerfile).
#
# .env is listed first and matters most: without it, a local .env would be copied into the image
# and every secret in it would be readable by anyone who can pull that image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
apps/web
.git
.github
docs
*.md
!apps/api/**/*.md
